    "regime": "Informative typed evidence and stable task-peer crossover. Stress rows are separate populations, never averaged into the main means.",
    "sampling_plan": "3 structural roots, 6 reset streams per root/arm, 120 started assignments/stream; conditional fixed-root expectations, not 18 independent root populations. This is a planning scenario, not an activated experiment card.",
    "range_semantics": "Subjective plausible ranges for paired differences, not observed or nominal 95% confidence intervals, not SD and not forecast coverage claims.",
    "range_quality_cost_joint": "Delta Y in [-0.016,0.056], Delta C in [0.05,0.19]; conservative rectangle implies Delta U in [-0.035,0.051]. No independent arbitrary utility error bar.",
    "prediction_target": "Producer-contract binary Qp on a common fixed labelled cohort. Later-use partial quality is a different target and population.",
    "service": "PeerSelect CPU path with cached features, 4 logical CPU cores, 1 GiB RAM budget, 3-neighbor menus, 1000 warm-up and 5000 scored arrivals. Update p95 is event validation through durable state update, excludes task generation and network LLM time. State bytes are selector state only, not model weights/RAM.",
    "forgetting": "Performance drop on the same frozen old-root cohort after a drift block, relative to its own pre-drift score. Frozen-prior control has zero expected parameter forgetting.",
    "safety": "Common owner-truth-available mutation population; attribution claim coverage + UNKNOWN = 1. Both primary arms share the deterministic gate on exactly the same input corpus. All-attempt false attribution is not conditional claimed-case error. Unknown-owner cases are a separate safety test, excluded from owner-truth rate. False attribution is an erroneous attribution verdict about a delivery, not a structurally forbidden source-publication parameter update. Source publication is a parameter no-op by invariant.",
    "assignment_change": "Change relative to the sealed pre-evidence decision with the same draw; diagnostic, not a success endpoint.",
    "recovery": "Post-drift new-task payoff returns to 95% of the frozen matched oracle reference for 5 consecutive windows; independent of forgetting on the old-root cohort. Restricted mean recovery capped at 20 updates; no-recovery cases count as 20, not dropped.",
    "service_cost_scope": "Primary complete-cost row is ArtifactRole only. PeerSelect latency/state is not monetized complete service cost; no currency prices or artifactrole token charges are imported. Full observed service resource accounting remains required at execution.",
    "unknown_precision": "Among UNKNOWN verdicts, fraction where the oracle-audited public contract actually requires abstention (insufficient permitted evidence); owner truth exists privately for all cases in this cohort. Weighted using stratum weight times UNKNOWN mass, not unweighted stratum precision."
  },
